            <div xml:id="d782">

                <pb facs="0824" n="814" xml:id="pg814"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.5151/12–1049</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Assistant Secretary of State for Far
                        Eastern Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Butterworth</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1949-12-10">December 10, 1949</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Symptomatic of the difficulties inherent in China which operate against any
                    Chinese Government under present circumstances is the fact that the official
                    rate of exchange between the U.S. dollar and the Communist currency has moved
                    since April of this year from 1 to 600 to the present 1 to 18,000.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. W[<hi rendition="#small-caps">alton</hi>] B[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">utterworth</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
